@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Receive and Categorize Invoice;
:Is the instruction to Forward Reject Return or Process for SAP?;
:v1: Is the instruction to Forward Reject Return or Process for SAP? ({Forward, Reject, Return, SAP}); <<objectSignal>>
switch ()
case ([v1 = 'Forward'])
:Sort Invoice;
stop
case ([v1 = 'Reject'])
stop
case ([v1 = 'SAP'])
:Forward Invoice for Validation;
:Validate Invoice;
stop
endswitch
@enduml